---
const repo = "https://github.com/strided-dev/strided"; // private for now, public later
---

<section class="status" id="status">
  <div class="status-content">
    <div class="status-label">Project status</div>
    <h2>Strided is in the 90-day validation window.</h2>
    <p>We're testing one question: can a deterministic rule engine match a senior CUDA engineer with two days of Nsight, on real customer dumps?</p>
    <p>If you operate LLM inference at scale and have a redacted Nsight or DCGM dump from a real workload, we want to test against it. We will not retain raw data. We will share the diagnosis with you.</p>
    <div class="status-cta">
      <a href="/submit" class="btn-dark">Send us a log →</a>
      <a href={repo} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-dark">Read the spec on GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .status { padding: var(--pad-y) var(--pad-x); background: var(--fixed-dark-paper); color: var(--fixed-dark-ink); }
  .status-content { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .status-label { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 11px; color: var(--amber); letter-spacing: 1.5px; margin-bottom: var(--space-4); text-transform: uppercase; }
  .status h2 { font-size: var(--fs-h2); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -1.5px; line-height: 1.3; max-width: 760px; margin-bottom: var(--space-8); }
  .status p { color: var(--fixed-dark-secondary); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }
  .status-cta { margin-top: var(--space-12); display: flex; gap: 14px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .btn-dark {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    border: 0.5px solid var(--fixed-dark-ink); background: transparent;
    color: var(--fixed-dark-ink); text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px;
    transition: all var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-instrument);
  }
  .btn-dark:hover { background: var(--amber); color: #2C2C2A; border-color: var(--amber); }
  @media (max-width: 480px) { .status-cta { flex-direction: column; } .status-cta .btn-dark { justify-content: center; } }
</style>
